# Link colors

Text links (including header controls like “Download CV”) must use the same colors as other content links. Do not override with `color: inherit`, body text color, or one-off accents.

Site default (`main.css`):

- default / visited: `#489ac1` (`--link`)
- hover / focus: `#198d98` (`--link-hover`)

```css
/* ❌ BAD — forces body text color */
.cv-download {
  color: inherit;
}

/* ✅ GOOD — leave color unset so `a` / `a:hover` styles apply */
.cv-download {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}
```

Nav is an exception: it intentionally uses `--color-primary` / `--color-secondary` for its own contrast.
